582
00:28:34,950 --> 00:28:35,760
Human beings.

583
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:41,900
I don't care if they're Hindu, or Muslim, or Jewish, or Christian, or whatever - Atheist.

584
00:28:41,900 --> 00:28:44,460
Whatever. Human beings have dignity, they have respect.

585
00:28:45,940 --> 00:28:48,220
Even if they don't have respect for you,

586
00:28:48,230 --> 00:28:51,320
You, as a Muslim, know that Allah gave respect to all human beings,

587
00:28:51,330 --> 00:28:52,660
You give respect to people.

588
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:56,160
That's what we have to - how we carry ourselves matters.

589
00:28:57,040 --> 00:28:59,960
So many times people in the name of Islam, in the name of the Quran,

590
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:02,770
