591
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,830
Uhh, no.

592
00:29:05,430 --> 00:29:06,770
No.

593
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:11,050
What Allah has a right to do and what you have a right to do are two different things.

594
00:29:11,540 --> 00:29:12,560
It's not the same thing,

595
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:13,550
you know?

596
00:29:13,940 --> 00:29:16,470
SubhaanAllah. Anyway, I digress.

